            "detailed_description": "Time Gun is a first person puzzle-platform video game.<br />\r\nPlayers control the &quot;time status&quot; of an object with a time gun. The goal of the game is to use the time gun to maneuver through the test chambers in order to complete the experiments. <br />\r\nFeatures include:<br />\r\nUnique game mechanisms: time stopping bullet and time rewinding bullet. <br />\r\nUnique game maps: Mobius map, trefoil knot map and more...<br />\r\nTime stopping bullet: the stopping time could be accumulated. One bullet equals 1 second.<br />\r\nTime rewinding bullet: the rewinding time could be accumulated. One bullet equals 1 second.",
